# Biome owns JS/TS/JSX/TSX formatting; Prettier keeps everything else (JSON,
# CSS/Tailwind, Vue, Svelte, Markdown, YAML) — the file types Biome cannot
# parse or that are codegen-owned data. Keep these globs in sync with the
# biome.json excludes so the two formatters never fight over the same file.
*.js
*.jsx
*.mjs
*.cjs
*.ts
*.tsx
*.mts
*.cts
